00:10:39.810 --> 00:10:45.050
We need to be very careful about what are
the numbers that we're considering, it sounds

00:10:45.050 --> 00:10:46.050
like.

00:10:46.050 --> 00:10:47.050
Speaker 5: Absolutely.

00:10:47.050 --> 00:10:54.120
I mean, it's my sense that there is no question
